----------------------

animation
=============
animation-name
animation-duration:time in second;
animation-delay: time in second;
animation-direction:normal | reverse | alternate | alternate-reverse
animation-iteration-count: number | infinite
animation-play-state: running | pause
animation-fill-mode:  none | forward | backward | both;
animation-timing-function:
linear - same speed from start to end
ease - start slow then fast  & end slow
ease-in - start slow
ease-out - end slow
ease-in-out -  starting slow ending slow
steps - steps


============
shorthand rule of animation
===============
animation: animation-name animation-duration timing-function delay iteration-count direction fill-mode play-state;


animation-name animation-duration--compulsory
timing-function delay iteration-count direction fill-mode play-state;--- optional


Syntax of animation ------- 

@keyframes animationName
{
    from{
        property:value;
        property:value;
        property:value;
    }
    to{
        property:value;
        property:value;
        property:value;
    }
}


@keyframes abc{
    0%{
         property:value;
        property:value;
        property:value;
    }
    100%{
         property:value;
        property:value;
        property:value;
    }
}
